    cde:designNote "Causes the oedema rather than manifesting as it: heart failure raises left atrial pressure and fluid accumulates, which is production of a second entity. Nothing here shows itself as anything, which is why it has no manifestation edge at all. Carried as a node so causal edges have a target; it has no imaging elements of its own and is not something a radiologist reports seeing." ;
