    cde:designNote "Anchored to the intracranial region, so it is a class rather than an abstraction. Acute versus chronic is a temporal-descriptor value on the class, not a further subtype: RadLex carries acute and chronic as children of temporal descriptor and has no acute-haemorrhage concept." ;
